      "cooked": "<p>Not sure which error you're referring to:</p><ol>\n<li>The ability to edit someone else's comment.</li>\n<li>The fact that there is no visible content and the content is limited to 51200 characters, but only 49850 remain.</li>\n</ol><p>&nbsp;</p><p>If the 1st, then I think the confusion is that 'grysqrl wrote' is the name of the forum topic, not the owner of the comment.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>If the 2nd, my guess is that the chracters are there but have been made white so we can't see them.</p>",
